---
// Root URL. The real home pages live at /en/ and /zh/ (i18n routing), so the
// bare / is a redirect page instead of a 404 on hosts that don't process
// Cloudflare _redirects (local dev/preview, generic static servers).
// Mirrors the legacy / /en/ 301 and / ?lang=zh /zh/ 301 rules. On Cloudflare
// Pages the _redirects rules take precedence and this page is never served.
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0; url=/en/">
    <title>Redirecting to Feather Tools</title>
</head>
<body>
    <script is:inline>
        (function () {
            var lang = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('lang');
            window.location.replace(lang === 'zh' ? '/zh/' : '/en/');
        })();
    </script>
    <p>Redirecting to <a href="/en/">Feather Tools</a>…</p>
</body>
</html>
